'''Brian Ratigan''' (born December 27, 1970) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] for the [[Indianapolis Colts]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL) in 1994. He played [[college football]] for the [[Notre Dame Fighting Irish football|Notre Dame Fighting Irish]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/R/RatiBr20.htm |title=Brian Ratigan Stats |publisher=Pro-Football-Reference.com |date= |access-date=June 6, 2019}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.nfl.com/player/brianratigan/2502589/profile |title=Brian Ratigan, LB |work=Nfl.com |date= |access-date=June 6, 2019}}</ref>
